!README.md

# Dockerfile.worker's CMD is `pnpm worker` -> `tsx scripts/run-worker.ts`, and
# run-worker.ts resolves the `server-only` stub out of src/__tests__ at runtime.
# Both directories are excluded above (they are dead weight in the Next.js app
# image), so without these two exceptions the worker image ships without its own
# entrypoint and crash-loops on ERR_MODULE_NOT_FOUND. This .dockerignore is
# shared by both Dockerfiles, so re-include exactly these two files and nothing
# else — the app image is unaffected in any meaningful way.
!scripts/run-worker.ts
!src/__tests__/__mocks__/server-only.ts

tsconfig.tsbuildinfo
